      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hwá Cristendom wyrde oððe hæþendom weorþige wordes oððe weorces, gylde swa wer swa wite swa lahslitte, be þam þe syo dæd sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone offends against the Christian religion, or honours heathen practices by word or deed, he shall pay either wergeld or fine or lahslit, according to the nature of the offence.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hwá Cristendom wyrde oððon hæðendom weorðige wordes oððe weorces, gylde swa wer swa wite swa lahslite, be ðam ðe seo dæd sy.</ab>
      </div>
